# The Hall of the Gods (Zilart 11), current. The Hall of the Gods' _6z0 says DEPRESSION_A_CLUE (messageText from the
# NPC, mode 6) and returns no action (so the NPC's own 1 does not play); Aldo plays 24; Norg's _700 plays the progress
# 169, whose finish on option 0 (not 1) completes the mission (The Mithra and the Crystal next); the next _700 is The
# Mithra and the Crystal's 5.
lists HallOfTheGods/_6z0/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Aldo/onTrigger Norg/_700/onTrigger Norg/onEventFinish/169
char zone=HallOfTheGods pos=0,-14,46 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart TheHallOfTheGods current
login
trigger _6z0                            # DEPRESSION_A_CLUE, no action
finish-if-event
warp 23,3,-58 LowerJeuno
trigger Aldo                            # 24
finish
warp 98,-7,-12 Norg
trigger _700                            # 169
finish option=1                         # nothing
trigger _700                            # 169
finish option=0                         # completed
trigger _700                            # The Mithra and the Crystal's 5
finish
